#: ../../howto/discussions.rst:163
msgid "Build"
msgstr "बिल्ड"

#: ../../howto/discussions.rst:171
msgid ""
"``dsc build`` writes the website to ``_build/html`` and one PDF per "
"record to ``_build/pdf``. Naming a record writes only its PDF, to "
"``_build/selected``, and leaves the complete output alone. Warnings stop "
"the build."
msgstr ""
"``dsc build`` वेबसाइट ``_build/html`` में और हर रिकॉर्ड का एक PDF "
"``_build/pdf`` में लिखता है। किसी रिकॉर्ड का नाम देने पर केवल उसका PDF "
"``_build/selected`` में लिखा जाता है, और पूरा आउटपुट जैसा था वैसा रहता "
"है। चेतावनी आने पर बिल्ड रुक जाता है।"

#: ../../howto/discussions.rst:175
msgid ""
"``dsc`` runs the ``guidedog`` named by ``--guidedog=PATH``, then by "
"``DSC_GUIDEDOG``, then the one on ``PATH``. ``dscc`` builds with the "
"Guidedog inside it."
msgstr ""
"``dsc`` पहले ``--guidedog=PATH`` में दिया गया ``guidedog`` चलाता है, फिर "
"``DSC_GUIDEDOG`` में दिया गया, फिर ``PATH`` पर मिलने वाला। ``dscc`` अपने "
"अंदर के Guidedog से बिल्ड करता है।"

#: ../../howto/discussions.rst:178
msgid "When an update is interrupted"
msgstr "जब अपडेट बीच में रुक जाए"

#: ../../howto/discussions.rst:181
msgid ""
"Commands that change records hold the catalog's lock, ``.eds.lock``. An "
"update of several files first writes a journal, ``.eds-journal.json``. If "
"it stops part way, the next command says so:"
msgstr ""
"रिकॉर्ड बदलने वाले कमांड कैटलॉग का लॉक, ``.eds.lock``, लेते हैं। कई "
"फ़ाइलों का अपडेट पहले एक जर्नल, ``.eds-journal.json``, लिखता है। अगर "
"अपडेट बीच में रुक जाए, तो अगला कमांड यह बताता है:"

#: ../../howto/discussions.rst:190
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Recovery puts back the files as they were. It refuses to overwrite a "
#| "file someone edited since. ``dsc`` also checks each change before it "
#| "writes anything: an empty or cut-short record, or an index without its "
#| "generated region, is refused. When memory runs out, the command stops "
#| "with exit status 3 and changes nothing it had not prepared whole."
msgid ""
"Recovery puts back the files as they were. It refuses to overwrite a file "
"someone edited since. ``dsc`` also checks each change before it writes "
"anything. It refuses an empty or cut-short record, and an index without "
"its generated region."
msgstr ""
